  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Sistem mesajı `history[0]`; kalanlar `history[1:]`.",
      "en": "The system message is `history[0]`; the rest `history[1:]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Son `keep` tanesi: `history[1:][-keep:]`; liste kısaysa dilim hepsini verir.",
      "en": "The last `keep` ones: `history[1:][-keep:]`; if the list is short the slice gives all."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef window(history, keep):\n    return [history[0]] + history[1:][-keep:]\n\n\nHISTORY = [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"S\"}] + [\n    {\"role\": \"user\" if i % 2 == 0 else \"assistant\", \"content\": f\"m{i}\"}\n    for i in range(6)]\nprint([m[\"content\"] for m in window(HISTORY, 3)])\nprint([m[\"content\"] for m in window(HISTORY, 10)])\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef window(history, keep):\n    return [history[0]] + history[1:][-keep:]\n\n\nHISTORY = [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"S\"}] + [\n    {\"role\": \"user\" if i % 2 == 0 else \"assistant\", \"content\": f\"m{i}\"}\n    for i in range(6)]\nprint([m[\"content\"] for m in window(HISTORY, 3)])\nprint([m[\"content\"] for m in window(HISTORY, 10)])\n```"
    }
